{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"手すりを握る","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"eec5ee489a1b60f50df5e603ab9d3a6a59a63f33f3376779412b090bf947943b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"よし、ここだ。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ？　もしかして……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"屋上に出るってことですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……でもこの扉、鍵がかかってますね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"下がっていていただけますか？　ここは、私のアーツで――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……いや。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"その必要はない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"蹴り飛ばせば済む話だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"勉強になったわね～、リスカム？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"や、やり方なんてそれぞれ違ってもいいでしょ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……それで……屋上には着きました、けど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ひょっとして、エクシアさんの言う「撤退ルート」って……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"アーミヤ、あの辺を目指してね！　そしたら、そのまま向こうまで行けるからさ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの辺、といいますと……や、やっぱり……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ここから飛び移れ、ってことですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ビンゴ！　その通り～～！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"天才的なアイデアじゃない！？　こんなの絶対予想外でしょ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"いや～、龍門みたいな秘密に溢れるすんばらしい街でも、ここまで――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":true,"text":"――待て！　そう簡単に逃げられるとは思うなよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"……ええっ！？　うっそ、どっから来たの！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"予想外のアイデアを持っているのは、向こうも同じのようですね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"だけど、入り口は塞いだのにどうやって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……恐らく、近くのビルから飛んできたのだと思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あの人たちが背負っているジェットパック……簡素な作りをしていますが、使う分に支障はないようですね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あれで奇襲をかけられたら、まずいことになるかもしれません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"エクシア","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"ちぇっ、しょーがないか。待っててね、今助けに行くから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"悪いけどさっさとしてよね、ラテラーノの救世主さん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"重装部隊は、防衛陣形に移行して！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……来るぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"みなさん、先鋒オペレーターの援護をお願いします！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["エクシア"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]}]}
